1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,460
There's a husband learning how to cook

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:07,140
All the meals she used to make

3
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:11,220
And a daddy shaving his own head

4
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:15,060
For his little boy's sake

5
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:18,420
There's a friend who drives three hours

6
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,460
Just to sit and hold a hand

7
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:25,700
And a night-shift nurse who's humming low

8
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:29,700
Till the morning comes again

9
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:33,620
Nobody asked to be here

10
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:36,340
Nobody chose this fight

11
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:40,500
But look at all this love still standing here

12
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:43,540
In the middle of the night
